1
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,080
-你好啊 莉莉 -你好啊
- Aloha, Lily. - Aloha.

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,098
不行 得再来一次
Oh, wait. Let's do it one more time.

3
00:00:07,098 --> 00:00:08,300
-小狗狗挡住小脸蛋了 -的确
- The doggy was blocking her face. - Yeah,

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,800
-回去再来 -我不要 我不要
- Go back. - No. No! No.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,900
我可不要再来第三次
We're not doing it a third time.

6
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,600
瞧瞧谁来了 茂伊岛上最美的人儿 夫人
There she is- the prettiest white woman on Maui. Milady.

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,466
说实话 当年克莱尔和我本来
Actually, Claire and I were supposed to

8
00:00:17,466 --> 00:00:18,960
-是要来夏威夷来度蜜月的 -没错
- go to Hawaii for our honeymoon. - Mm-hmm.

9
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,100
可出现了点状况
But something else came up.

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,980
-我怀上了海莉 -都是哥的错
- I got pregnant with Haley. - My bad!

11
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,700
我们甚至连像样的婚礼都没办
We didn't even have a proper wedding.

12
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,820
就随便挑了一个礼拜二去法院登记了
We just went down to the courthouse on a Tuesday.

13
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:32,160
我从此就被判"无期婚姻"徒刑 且不准假释
The judge sentenced me to life with no chance of parole.

14
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,775
当时可是你求我嫁给你的
You begged me to marry you.

15
00:00:33,775 --> 00:00:34,992
没错 我求了
It's true. I did.

16
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,260
慢点 我的娘子 来吧
Oh! Hold on, my bride. Allow me!

17
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,420
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

18
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,660
浪漫一下 天呐 你真重
Being romantic. God, you're solid.

19
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,820
亲爱的 快放我下来 慢慢来 好了
Sweetie, put me down. Go on. Okay.

20
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:44,700
亲爱的 别这样
Honey, come on.

21
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,760
让我们把这次假期当成在度蜜月吧
Let's turn this vacation into a honeymoon.

22
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,860
亲爱的 我可是带着孩子来旅行的
Sweet pea, I'm a mom traveling with my kids.

23
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,280
对我来说 这不是度假
For me, this is not a vacation.

24
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,720
是出差 跟我走
It's a business trip. Let's go.

25
00:00:56,495 --> 00:00:57,400
真不错
This'll do.

26
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,101
-太漂亮了 -大家好啊
- It's beautiful. - Aloha!

27
00:00:59,101 --> 00:01:02,613
欢迎入住四季酒店茂伊店
Hi! Welcome to the Four Seasons Maui.

28
00:01:02,613 --> 00:01:04,104
感觉怎样 曼尼
What do you think, Manny?

29
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:07,700
宾至如归啊
I'm home.

30
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:25,300
我们居然还有自己的房间
I can't believe we have our own hotel room.

31
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:27,440
太棒了 这里还有个熨斗
Score! There's an iron in here!

32
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:30,540
你就不能把房间弄得整洁点吗
Don't you want to keep our room neat?

33
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,820
万一有客人来怎么办
You know, in case we entertain.

34
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,320
谁会来啊
Who would we entertain?

35
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:35,900
我看到儿童俱乐部里有好多可爱的小姑娘
I noticed some lovely tweens down by the kids' club.

36
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,259
没准我们能在泳池边找个机会搭讪
Maybe we can find a nice spot near them by the pool...

37
00:01:38,259 --> 00:01:40,600
再奉上一杯"处女红"鸡尾酒
and send over a couple of virgin mai tais.

38
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,320
她们没准喜欢我们这种成熟老练的男人
They may be interested in two sophisticated men like us.

39
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,760
我是浴室战神
I am a bathroom martian!

40
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:52,940
我来自伟大的卫生间星云
I am from the nebula of the Great Toilet.

41
00:01:55,853 --> 00:01:58,800
给我来一个你们这里最大的芝士汉堡
I want the biggest cheeseburger you got.

42
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,080
把沙拉换成薯条
Instead of salad, I want fries.

43
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:02,360
把水果换成辣薯条
Instead of fruit, I want chili fries.

44
00:02:02,907 --> 00:02:04,720
海莉 亲爱的 别玩手机了
Haley, sweetie, put the phone down

45
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,960
快涂点防晒霜
and put on some sunscreen. Please?

46
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:08,595
我们得时刻盯着这些孩子
We have got to stay on these kids all day,

47
00:02:08,595 --> 00:02:10,780
-不然他们准得晒伤 -绝对的
- or else they're gonna burn. - Totally.

48
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,962
他们就早上涂了那么一小点防晒霜
They put on the littlest bit of sunscreen in the morning,

49
00:02:12,962 --> 00:02:14,601
就以为没事了
they think it's got them covered for the-

50
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,860
你是不是在透过我的墨镜偷看歌洛莉亚
Are you watching Gloria in my sunglasses?

51
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,520
是她在做慢动作 还是我在胡思乱想
Is she moving in slow motion, or is my brain doing that?

52
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,000
-菲尔 认真点 -继续说 我听着呢
- Phil, this is important. - Go ahead. I'm glistening.

53
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:23,700
嘿 大家好啊
Hey, everybody.

54
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,620
我们正要去看世界上最大的榕树
We're on our way to see the world's largest banyan tree.

55
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,480
有人想一起来吗
Does anybody want to come?

56
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:29,620
谁会吃饱了撑着 要离开这片仙境
Now, why in the hell would anyone want to leave paradise,

57
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:32,920
去坐闷热无比的车只为看一棵树
take a hot bus ride to see a tree?

58
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:36,120
我最欣赏卡梅隆的一点是
The great thing about Cameron is that,

59
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,710
他勇于探索 和我一样
uh, he's adventurous, like I am.

60
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:40,080
我们都喜欢入乡随俗
We-We both like to immerse ourselves in the culture

61
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,460
更多地了解本地居民
and really get to know the locals.

62
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:42,938
我们的朋友遍布全球
We've made friends all over the world.

63
00:02:42,938 --> 00:02:44,960
我们至今还和伊伦加保持着联系
We're still in touch with Elunga,

64
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,380
他是我们在坦桑尼亚狩猎旅行时认识的
a man we met on safari in Tanzania.

65
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:50,240
我们经常寄旧衣服给他
We actually send him... all of our old clothes.

66
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,380
我们结识时 他还是个很善良的人
He was a very nice man when we met him,

67
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:54,780
但就最近的回信来看
but based on his recent letters,

68
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,860
我有点担心他已经变成军阀了
I have a small fear he's become a warlord.

69
00:02:59,551 --> 00:03:02,220
嘿 我要去健身房运动下
Hey. I'm gonna go to the gym to work out a little bit.

70
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:02,920
你要一起来吗
You want to come with me?

71
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:05,240
我刚刚特地叫了一根超长吸管
I just ordered an extra-long straw

72
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,980
就是为了不想坐起来
to avoid accidentally doing a sit-up.

73
00:03:08,805 --> 00:03:09,896
猜猜谁来电
Ah, look at this.

74
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:11,060
我弟弟
My brother.

75
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,440
干吗 蠢货
What's up, jackass?

76
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,340
生日快乐 你个二逼
Happy birthday, you dumb son of a bitch.

77
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:16,820
明天才是我的生日 蠢蛋
Birthday's tomorrow, moron!

78
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,680
真搞不懂你们兄弟俩
I never understood this relationship.

79
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,660
-63岁了对吧 -没想到你还会数数
- So, 63, right? - Hey, you can count!

80
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:23,800
你记得老爸就是63岁死的吧
You know Dad was 63 when he died. Huh?

81
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:26,700
-喂 - 多谢提醒
- Hello? - Thanks for reminding me.

82
00:03:27,019 --> 00:03:29,241
别担心 是他不懂得好好保养身体
Ah, don't worry. He never took care of himself.

83
00:03:29,241 --> 00:03:31,289
总是吃垃圾食品 喝得烂醉如泥
Ate like crap and drank too much.

84
00:03:31,289 --> 00:03:33,100
管他呢 艾琳在求我...
Anyway, Irene's begging me for-

85
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:34,520
等等我 歌洛莉亚 我来了
Hey, Gloria, wait up. I'm coming.

86
00:03:37,895 --> 00:03:41,964
我在想要不要给我们预定一个夫妻按摩
So, I was thinking we book a couples' massage.

87
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:44,060
我正巧看到一对在做
I accidentally looked in on one.

88
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:46,300
他们没看到我之前可放松呢
They seemed really relaxed until they noticed me.

89
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,120
海莉 够了 快挂电话
Haley, that's enough. Get off the phone.

90
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:49,740
卢克 裤子拉拉好
Luke, pull up your trunks!

91
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:52,000
你穿这身泳衣真好看
This bathing suit looks great on you.

92
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,321
谢谢夸奖 海莉 别打了 快
Thanks, sweetie. Haley, come on. Off the phone.

93
00:03:54,321 --> 00:03:56,777
不是吧 凯拉把她的头发拉直了
No way. Keira got her hair straightened?

94
00:03:57,466 --> 00:04:00,379
克莱尔 为表达对你的爱 我决定这么做
Claire, consider this a grand gesture of my love.

95
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,360
你干嘛...
What are you-

96
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,456
噢 天呐
Oh, my God!

97
00:04:03,456 --> 00:04:06,580
-你都做了什么 -菲尔 你在想什么
- What did you do? - Phil, what are you thinking?

98
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,000
那手机可贵呢
That is an expensive cell phone.

99
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:09,140
好戏才刚刚开始
It's just the beginning.

100
00:04:09,456 --> 00:04:11,980
做好准备吧 我要向你展开攻势了
Buckle your seat belt, lady. You're being wooed.

101
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:14,500
在自然界中 雄性通常会吃掉幼崽
In nature, fathers are known to eat their young.

102
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,800
是因为幼崽好吃吗 不是
Is it because they're delicious? No.

103
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,500
是因为它们想给雌性伴侣
It's because they want to give their female-

104
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:22,580
比如熊啊 长颈鹿啊 随便什么
bear, giraffe, what have you-

105
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,500
一个甜蜜的蜜月
the honeymoon they never had.

106
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:28,400
事先声明 我不是说吃孩子是可以原谅的
Just to be clear, I'm not condoning eating your kids,

107
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:31,080
可我知道长颈鹿这么做的本意是什么
but I sure as heck know why giraffes do it.

108
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:32,780
什么
What?

109
00:04:40,753 --> 00:04:43,280
-起床来 懒虫 -别闹了 杰
- Come on, sleepy! - Ay, Jay!

110
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,960
快起床 宝贝 别赖床了
Come on, honey! Get out of bed!

111
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,276
我刚预订了个划艇
I just booked us on an outrigger.

112
00:04:46,276 --> 00:04:48,080
可今天是你的生日
But it is your birthday.

113
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:49,181
你就不想睡个懒觉
You don't want to sleep in?

114
00:04:49,181 --> 00:04:49,860
-快来 -不 不
- Come here. - No, no,

115
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:51,680
我刚从健身房回来 猜我刚举起多重
I just came from the gym. Guess how much I benched.

116
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:54,440
-不知道 500磅 -500磅
- I don't know. 500 pounds? - 500 pounds?

117
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,240
你当我是叉车啊
What am I, a forklift?

118
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,160
实话和你说吧
To tell you the truth,

119
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,300
我老弟那通电话把我吓惨了
that call from my brother scared the hell out of me.

120
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,960
我决定尽快练回健康身材
I decided to get in better shape quick.

121
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:04,860
我可不想步我老爸的后尘
Didn't want to end up like my old man.

122
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,400
不过他算是死于他热爱的事业中
Although he did die doing what he loved-

123
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,080
拒绝向来店里的嬉皮士提供服务
refusing service to hippies who came into his store.

124
00:05:10,630 --> 00:05:12,807
曼尼是有史以来最差的室友
Manny is the worst roommate ever.

125
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,780
他看到什么都要叠起来
Everything he finds, he folds.

126
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:16,380
亲爱的 忍忍几天就过去了
Sweetie, it's only for a few more days.

127
00:05:16,660 --> 00:05:18,180
昨晚还做了火灾演习
Last night we had a fire drill.

128
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:20,840
不是整个酒店 就我俩
Not the hotel. Just us.

129
00:05:21,260 --> 00:05:22,740
-你们好啊 -你们好
- Hi, guys. - Hey.

130
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,518
今天准备去哪探险呢
So, what's today's big adventure?

131
00:05:27,518 --> 00:05:29,200
我敢打赌孩子们肯定都想和你们去
I'll bet the kids want to go with you.

132
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,599
今天可是去个好地方 薰衣草牧场
Well, it is a big one- the lavender ranch,

133
00:05:31,599 --> 00:05:34,447
-那里种45种不同的薰衣草哦 -45种哦
- where they grow 45 different varieties of lavender. - Forty-five.

134
00:05:34,447 --> 00:05:37,380
听到没 孩子们 45种不同的薰衣草哦
Hear that, kids? Forty-five different varieties.

135
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:38,999
好吧 实在说不动他们 祝旅途愉快
Yeah, I can't sell that. Go with God.

136
00:05:38,999 --> 00:05:41,640
那就没人和我们抢了
Oh. Well, more lavender for us.

137
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,920
米奇尔和我初遇时
When Mitchell and I first met,

138
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:46,000
我可能夸大了我对探险的狂热之情
I may have exaggerated my interest in adventurous travel...

139
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,800
我说我有很多此类经历
by implying that I had any.

140
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:50,520
可他偏偏最爱我这点
But it's one of the things he loves most about me,

141
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:52,199
导致我现在不能道出事实
and I can't tell him the truth now.

142
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:54,440
就好像路易斯告诉克拉克
It would be like Lewis telling Clark

143
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,840
他其实不喜欢徒步一样
that he didn't like to walk.

144
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:56,960
补充说明一下
Side note.

145
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:00,120
路易斯和克拉克夫夫是我们的一对好朋友
We're very good friends with a couple named Lewis and Clark.

146
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,620
克拉克在新奥尔良买了一块巨大的地皮
Clark bought a big, sparkly belt in New Orleans

147
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,180
他将之与政府当年购买路易斯安那州相提并论
that he calls his Louisiana Purchase.

148
00:06:05,562 --> 00:06:08,340
妈妈 海莉一直偷我的ipod
Mom, Haley keeps stealing my iPod.

149
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:11,480
我的歌都在手机上 你让我怎么办
All my music is on my phone. What else am I supposed to do?

150
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,940
曼尼整天看新闻
Manny watches the news.

151
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,060
连你们都不怎么看新闻
You guys don't even watch the news.

152
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,040
你们好 对不起
Aloha. Hi. Sorry, folks.

153
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,580
这泳池是成人专用
This pool is for adults only.

154
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:21,080
-别回头 -什么
- Don't turn around. - What?

155
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,540
听我的 往前走就是了
Trust me. Just keep walking.

156
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:24,120
等等 你们要去哪儿
Wait! Where are you guys going?

157
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,060
爹妈
Guys?

158
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:28,140
什么情况
What just happened?

159
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,860
我们到时能一边喝薰衣草茶
Ooh, so we can drink lavender tea

160
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:35,160
一边吃薰衣草饼
while eating lavender scones.

161
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:38,940
真棒 一整天都这么过还是怎么着
Oh, neat! So, is this an all-day thing or-

162
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:41,000
不是的 我知道你在想什么 小卡
Oh, no. I know what you're thinking, Cam.

163
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,359
别担心 我们还有时间参观捕鲸村落
Don't worry. We'll still have time for the whaling village.

164
00:06:43,359 --> 00:06:45,167
那就好
Oh. Good. So-

165
00:06:46,420 --> 00:06:46,860
很好
Okay.

166
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:52,180
-我不行 -什么
- I can't. - What?

167
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:53,540
我不想去了
I don't want to go.

168
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,340
我知道我说过
I know I said

169
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:55,860
我不是那种慵懒不爱动的人
I'm not a stay-by-the-pool type of guy,

170
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:56,880
可我骨子里就是 米奇尔
but I really am, Mitchell.

171
00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:57,980
你在说什么
What are you saying?

172
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:59,360
我是喜欢探险
I'm saying that I like adventure,

173
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:01,020
可也用不着每分每秒都投身于此
but not every minute of every day.

174
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,280
你能自己一个人去吗
Can you just go by yourself?

175
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,360
那可是薰衣草农场啊
But... the lavender ranch-

176
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:07,200
注定要两个相爱的人一起享受的
It's- It's something two men are meant to do together.

177
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:10,700
-到底去不去 -我去
- On or off, folks? - Well, I'm on.

178
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,900
我不去
I'm off.

179
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:17,120
想想你错过了什么 小卡
Think about what you're missing, Cam.

180
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:19,100
整个牧场都是薰衣草哦
It's an entire ranch full of lavender.

181
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:21,980
你说得再天花乱坠都没用
You're not making the compelling case you think you are!

182
00:07:27,782 --> 00:07:29,641
嘿 小兔崽子们
Hey, you little monkey!

183
00:07:29,641 --> 00:07:32,120
别光站着 给我下去
No standing around! There you go!

184
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,820
又一个下来咯 下去
Here goes another one! There you go!

185
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,060
又一个下来咯 下去
Here comes another one! There you go!

186
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,360
我以为你是我们家的小孩
I thought you were one of ours!

187
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,358
杰 当心点
Hey, Jay! Be careful!

188
00:07:42,358 --> 00:07:44,640
别伤着人家 特别是你自己
You're gonna hurt somebody- like you!

189
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:45,459
别太惬意哦
Don't get too comfortable.

190
00:07:45,459 --> 00:07:47,815
-我刚定好了网球场 -好
- I reserved us a tennis court. - Yay.

191
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:51,080
我以为嫁给一个老头的好处之一是
I thought that one of the advantages of marrying an older guy...

192
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,480
生活能过的轻松点
was that I was going to be able to relax.

193
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:56,100
可他又是游泳又是跑步又是划船
But all this swimming and running and rowing-

194
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:59,520
简直跟我的同胞们偷渡来美国的过程差不多
It's just like how some of my relatives got into this country.

195
00:08:00,481 --> 00:08:01,640
你知道吗
You know- Mmm.

196
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,980
你比我们结婚时更漂亮了
You look prettier now than the day we got married.

197
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:06,180
亲爱的 你也更帅了
Oh, honey. And you are even more handsome.

198
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,620
我有在浴室里偷偷练俯卧撑
I did push-ups in the bathroom.

199
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:09,900
你真"幽默"
You're funny.

200
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:12,480
-你真好 -我一直都这么好
- You're nice. -I have always been nice.

201
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,460
我也一直很幽默
I've always been funny.

202
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:17,380
好吧
Well-

203
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:20,140
老妈 老爸
Mom! Dad!

204
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:22,272
别理她 可能是在叫其他人
Ignore her. That could be anyone.

205
00:08:22,272 --> 00:08:25,867
菲尔和克莱尔·邓菲
Phil and Claire Dunphy?

206
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,960
海莉 亲爱的 怎么了
Yes, Haley, honey? What is it?

207
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:32,320
我去和隔壁的一些孩子
I'm gonna go get some shaved ice at the hotel

208
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,560
一起去吃点刨冰
next door with some kids.

209
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:36,760
-什么孩子 -就是在泳池边的那些
- What kids? - Just some kids I met at the pool.

210
00:08:36,985 --> 00:08:39,980
-好吧 我得去看看 -克莱尔 别去
- Okay. Um- I should go with her and - Claire, no.

211
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:41,680
你得学会放手
You have to learn to let go.

212
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:45,260
把家庭度假变成度蜜月 要坚持做到哦
Turning a family vacation into a honeymoon takes commitment.

213
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:49,180
你能做到 猛虎之眼
You can do it. Eye of the tiger.

214
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,216
怎么说
Hello!

215
00:08:51,216 --> 00:08:53,152
-至少得见见他们 -不行
- I should at least meet them. I - No.

216
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:57,560
你这可不是猛虎之眼
That is not eye of the tiger.

217
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:05,300
好吧 海莉 亲爱的 玩的开心点
All right, Haley, honey, go and have fun,

218
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:06,780
但可不能上陌生人的车
but don't get in anybody's car...

219
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:10,140
准时回来参加你外公的生日 知道了吗
and be back in time for your grandfather's birthday dinner, okay?

220
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:10,958
谢谢
Thank you!

221
00:09:10,958 --> 00:09:13,225
-好吧 快去快回 -再见 亲爱的
- Okay! All right! - Bye, honey!

222
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,440
天呐
Oh, God.

223
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:19,840
这感觉真是又诡异又舒爽
That feels weird and good all at once.

224
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:22,500
当然 刚刚我也靠在那喷头上呢
I know. I was leaning up against that nozzle a minute ago.

225
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:29,420
-嘿 -你回来啦 感觉怎样
- Hey. - Hey, you're back. How was it?

226
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,420
卡梅隆 那真是我这辈子
Ah! Cameron, it was the most incredible thing

227
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:32,980
见过最美的东西
I've ever seen in my entire life.

228
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:34,100
-真的吗 -你到我在那碰到谁了吗
- Really? - You know who else was there?

229
00:09:34,180 --> 00:09:35,500
-谁 -艾尔顿·约翰
- Who - Elton John.

230
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:38,120
-不会吧 -真的 他也被美景深深吸引了
- No- -Yes, and he was so blown away by the beauty of it,

231
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,740
你坐在用薰衣草装点的钢琴前
he sat down... at their lavender piano

232
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:40,860
演奏了一曲《小舞人》
and played "Tiny Dancer."

233
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:43,420
我顿感心有灵犀 因为他也热爱探险
And we bonded, because he too likes adventure.

234
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,460
-这些都是真的吗 -不 当然是假的
- Did that really happen? - No, that didn't really happen.

235
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:45,980
我只是觉得
I'm just...

236
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:48,780
只是想报复你抛弃我
trying to get back at you for bailing on me.

237
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:50,140
很抱歉 如果你真想和我一起
I'm sorry. If it means anything,

238
00:09:50,140 --> 00:09:51,900
我们在这什么也不做也很开心
we've been relaxing here doing nothing.

239
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,400
-也许明天你能和我们一起 -不行
- Maybe you can join us tomorrow. - No, I can't- I just don't-

240
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,520
-我实在不觉得放松有什么意思 -我懂
- I don't find relaxing that relaxing. - I understand.

241
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,520
你生性如此难再改
You are who you are.

242
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,080
-蕾拉妮 -来了
- Leilani. - Yes.

243
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,737
你知道吗 我想可能是我受我爸妈的影响
You know what? I think it's because of my parents.

244
00:10:01,737 --> 00:10:04,400
当然了 奇普
It always is. Kipu!

245
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,800
我是说 和我爸妈一起度假
I mean, vacation with my mom and dad

246
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:07,860
就像坐在两个雕像旁边一样
was them sitting around like statues...

247
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:11,120
我和克莱尔唯一能找到的乐子就是
when, the only thing that me and Claire could do for excitement was-

248
00:10:12,140 --> 00:10:14,498
坐着听自己的皮肤晒得吱吱作响
Was sit around and listen to my skin sizzle.

249
00:10:14,498 --> 00:10:17,260
-你真可怜 苏 -来了
- You poor thing. Sue? - Yes.

250
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:19,480
那就是为什么 每当我出来度假
So, that's, like- That's why, when I'm on vacation,

251
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,180
我就想出去见见当地人
I want to go out and meet the locals.

252
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,901
想让自己融入当地的文化 明白吗
I want to immerse myself in the culture, you know?

253
00:10:23,901 --> 00:10:25,940
我可不想一整天都这么懒洋洋的
I don't want to sloth around- Ah!

254
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:27,520
我的个嘎嘎 太舒服了
Sweet Lady Gaga, that is good.

255
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:32,460
谢谢
Thank you.

256
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,600
这叫什么
What's this called?

257
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:38,440
幸福
Happiness.

258
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:46,180
我很好奇 是我们浴室里的沙子没弄走
I'm curious. Is there any sand left on the beach,

259
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:48,000
还是你带回我们浴室里来了
or did you bring it all up to our bathroom?

260
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,860
抱歉了 老妈
Sorry, Mom.

261
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:52,080
而你现在又坐在我的亚麻夹克上
And now you're sitting on my linen jacket.

262
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,380
我就不能有件像样的东西吗
I guess I can't have nice things.

263
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:57,560
-对不起 我不知道它在那 -没关系
- Oh. I'm sorry. I didn't know it was there. - It's okay.

264
00:10:59,105 --> 00:10:59,920
不 快停下
No! Stop!

265
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:00,680
我今晚可是要穿的
I'm wearing that tonight!

266
00:11:00,940 --> 00:11:03,160
我把你的衣服弄皱咯
I'm wrinkling your linen! I'm wrinkling your linen!

267
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,520
这是你逼我的 滚出去
Ooh! You know what? Out!

268
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,600
给我滚出去 这样不行
I want you out! This isn't working!

269
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:10,480
我不管你去哪里 只要别在这就行了
I don't care where you go, as long as you don't stay here!

270
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,700
你说什么
What are you saying?

271
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:13,720
你听不懂"出去"两个字吗
What don't you understand about "Out"?

272
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,700
走就走 我去和我姐姐们住
Fine. I'll just move in with my sisters.

273
00:11:18,974 --> 00:11:21,900
是谁小便都不能瞄准 到处都是
Oh, no! Who will pee all over the bathroom floor?

274
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:24,120
我当时还在刷牙呢 高难度
I was brushing my teeth at the same time.

275
00:11:24,426 --> 00:11:26,237
你给我试试看
You try to do that.

276
00:11:28,178 --> 00:11:29,656
你今天都做了什么
What'd you do today?

277
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,220
-我打了个盹 -真的吗
- I napped. - You did?

278
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,440
-我好几年都没打过盹了 -感觉很棒 对吧
- I haven't napped in years. - Yeah. It feels good, doesn't it?

279
00:11:33,620 --> 00:11:34,800
嗯 又奇怪又舒爽
Mm-hmm. Good and weird.

280
00:11:35,093 --> 00:11:37,180
就像无边泳池里的那个喷头一样
Kinda like that one nozzle in the infinity pool.

281
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,460
不知道 菲尔把那给占了
I wouldn't know. Phil was hogging it.

282
00:11:40,766 --> 00:11:42,580
是我的错觉还是莉莉真的比以前更放松了
Is it me, or is Lily more relaxed here?

283
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:43,680
不是你的错觉
Oh, yes. She is.

284
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:46,139
我觉得她是受到我们的影响了
I think it's because she's really picking up on our energy, you know?

285
00:11:46,139 --> 00:11:48,960
就好像要是我们紧张了 她也会跟着紧张
It's like, if we're tense, she's gonna be tense.

286
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,761
我觉得我们得把这种正能量带回家
And I think we need to bring this new energy home.

287
00:11:50,761 --> 00:11:51,818
可以使我们更好地为人父母
It's gonna make us better parents-

288
00:11:52,922 --> 00:11:54,516
-你关了 -什么 什么情况
- You blocked the - What? What happened?

289
00:11:54,516 --> 00:11:56,370
-你没带她出来 -我以为你带着
- You didn't bring her out! - I thought you had her!

290
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,500
来吧 让我来为你画张像
Come on. Let me paint you.

291
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:05,100
亲爱的 会不会太重口味了
Oh, sweetie. That is so creepy.

292
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:07,340
人都到哪去了
Where is everyone?

293
00:12:08,940 --> 00:12:11,860
好吧 我来说说大家的想法
Okay. Let me just say what everyone's thinking.

294
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,660
我的夹克太皱了
My jacket's a mess.

295
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:14,920
本不该这样的
It wouldn't be,

296
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:17,460
可有人竟然用熨斗来烤奶酪
but someone used the iron to make grilled cheese.

297
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:20,636
我有面包 有奶酪 外加一个熨斗
I had bread, I had cheese and I had an iron.

298
00:12:20,636 --> 00:12:22,087
我还能怎么做
What was I supposed to do?

299
00:12:22,087 --> 00:12:25,318
孩子们 别胡闹 我们不在乎
Kids, kids. We don't care.

300
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:26,795
大家好啊
Hola, hola!

301
00:12:26,795 --> 00:12:30,243
抱歉我迟到了 杰去哪了
Hey. So sorry I'm late. Where is Jay?

302
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,100
他不是和你在一起吗
He's not with you?

303
00:12:31,300 --> 00:12:32,940
没啊 他早就下来了
No, he came down long time ago.

304
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:34,900
别担心 我去找找
Oh, don't worry. I'll go have a look around.

305
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:37,000
是啊 他也许正在海里
Yeah, he's probably in the ocean trying to

306
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,640
用牙齿拖船呢
pull a tugboat with his teeth.

307
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,180
看看谁来了
Well, look who decided to join us.

308
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:45,220
-你姐呢 -她在浴室狂吐呢
- And where is your sister? - She is in our bathroom throwing up.

309
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,480
什么情况
Well, what happened? -

310
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,800
我看到她现在的样子也很痛心
You're not going to like this as much as I do,

311
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,340
可她喝多了
but she's drunk.

312
00:12:51,729 --> 00:12:54,540
我就知道不该纵容她的
I-I knew I never should have let her-

313
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:55,480
有戏看咯
That's awesome.

314
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,640
我敢保证我们的浴室肯定更恶心
Guarantee our bathroom is still messier.

315
00:13:02,928 --> 00:13:05,391
我的天呐 莉莉 电梯到哪去了
Oh, my God! Lily! Where is the elevator?

316
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:08,420
我不管了 我走楼梯去了
Where- I don't know! I'm taking the stairs!

317
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:10,380
莉莉 我们来救你了
Lily, we're coming for you!

318
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:17,880
嘿 你这是要去哪
Hey, you. Where you headed?

319
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:20,600
还记得先前在泳池 你说服我
Well, remember earlier in the pool when you convinced me...

320
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,600
放手让海莉去和隔壁的陌生人去玩
to let Haley go next door with complete strangers?

321
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:24,880
-你当时完全同意的 -没错
- And you were totally on board. - Yeah. Mm-hmm. Yeah, well,

322
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,680
可她现在喝醉了 还在上面狂吐
she got drunk, and now she's upstairs throwing up.

323
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:28,580
可她还是个孩子 谁给她的酒
But she's just a kid. Who would serve her?

324
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,880
是我们 亲爱的 我们亲手奉上的
We did, honey. On a silver platter.

325
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:33,680
你说服我要放轻松 随她去玩
You convinced me to relax and let go,

326
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:34,800
看看落下什么结果
and now this happens.

327
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:37,540
我很抱歉 别太为我们
I'm sorry, but we shouldn't feel bad...

328
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:38,980
因共享二人世界而付出的代价自责
About wanting a little time for ourselves.

329
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:40,880
亲爱的 这不是在度蜜月
Sweetie, this isn't a honeymoon.

330
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:42,714
我们已经为人父母 你得放弃那个想法了
We have kids. You have got to let this go.

331
00:13:42,714 --> 00:13:46,040
从现在起 我不会让他们离开我的视线一步
From now on, I am not losing sight of them for two seconds.

332
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:48,280
什么都别想逃过我的法眼
Nothing gets past me.

333
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:50,220
找到杰了吗
Did you find Jay?

334
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:51,220
我有点担心了
I'm getting worried.

335
00:13:51,740 --> 00:13:53,340
很抱歉 我得去处理一下海莉的问题
I'm sorry. I have to deal with Haley.

336
00:13:53,660 --> 00:13:55,520
不用了 亲爱的 我去处理海莉
No. You know what, sweetie? I will deal with Haley.

337
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,860
你继续去找找老爸
You go see if you can find Dad.

338
00:13:57,100 --> 00:13:58,360
我去外面找找
I'll look for him out there.

339
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:03,540
莉莉 你个小家伙是要去哪儿
Lily, where are you going, huh?

340
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:09,620
我的天呐
Oh, my God.

341
00:14:09,700 --> 00:14:11,460
-对不起 -我的天呐
- I'm so sorry. - Oh, my God.

342
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:12,918
你在想些什么啊
Wow. What were you thinking?

343
00:14:12,918 --> 00:14:17,120
有个孩子有身份证 她就买了些酒
One of the kids had an I.D., and she bought some drinks.

344
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:19,839
我喝了一口 结果就止不住了
I tried one, and then another one.

345
00:14:19,839 --> 00:14:21,580
我真傻
It was stupid.

346
00:14:21,580 --> 00:14:23,920
的确 的确很傻
Yes. Yes, it was stupid,

347
00:14:23,940 --> 00:14:25,420
不过你还算幸运
but you are really lucky

348
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:27,320
没有遭遇更可怕的事
that this did not end as badly as it could have.

349
00:14:28,022 --> 00:14:29,857
所以我们从小教育你
This is why we always say to you...

350
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:32,080
一旦喝醉 就会犯糊涂
when you drink, you make bad decisions.

351
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:34,940
我知道 我知道 只是
I know, I know. I just-

352
00:14:36,330 --> 00:14:38,940
前一分钟还在返校节派对上喝酒
One minute you're having wine coolers at homecoming,

353
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:39,940
接下来
and the next...

354
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:43,060
我克莱尔就火遍全校了
the game of Truth or Claire sweeps your high school.

355
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:47,300
谢谢你没骂我
Thanks for not yelling at me.

356
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:50,060
亲爱的 那样就太狠心了
Oh, honey. That would just be cruel.

357
00:14:50,697 --> 00:14:52,444
我会等到你酒醒了再骂你的
I'II wait till you feel better to yell.

358
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,960
我觉得我永远不会好起来了
I don't think I'll ever feel better.

359
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,920
每次喝酒都会这样吗
Does this happen every time you drink?

360
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:02,600
是的
Yes.

361
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:05,300
是的
Yes, it does.

362
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:08,920
杰
Jay?

363
00:15:11,020 --> 00:15:11,740
在这呢
Over here.

364
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:16,897
你在干什么呢
What are you doing?

365
00:15:16,897 --> 00:15:20,020
我起不来了 一躺下我腰就折了
I'm stuck. I laid down, my back went out.

366
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:23,180
别担心 我会帮你的
Oh. Well, don't you worry. We're gonna get you out of here.

367
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:26,100
-抓着我 -好的 菲尔 这样做也许不大好
- Grab on. - Yeah, you know, Phil, this might not be the best-

368
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:26,740
不 不 不
No, no, no, no, no.

369
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:29,020
我要像飓风一样震撼到你[歌曲名]
I'm just gonna rock you- like a hurricane.

370
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:31,100
开个玩笑 你应该听不懂 来了
I'm kidding. You're too old to get that. Here we go.

371
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,639
等等 干嘛不去找工作人员
Wait. Why don't you just get someone who works here?

372
00:15:32,639 --> 00:15:33,782
不 我可以的
No, this is gonna work.

373
00:15:33,782 --> 00:15:36,146
准备好
And now- Oh, wow!

374
00:15:36,146 --> 00:15:37,448
我抽筋了
There's spasming.

375
00:15:37,448 --> 00:15:39,167
-别动 -我不想...
- Don't move. - No. I don't wanna get-

376
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:52,420
顺便说一下 我很感谢你给我们这次度假的机会
By the way, I just want to thank you for this trip.

377
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:54,000
这是我一生中最美好的一次度假
It's really been a vacation of a lifetime.

378
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:57,100
此地绝无基情
Nothing weird!

379
00:15:58,800 --> 00:15:59,220
你们好
Aloha.

380
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:05,460
我把钱包放在前面口袋了 所以才...
I keep my wallet in my front pocket, so that's-

381
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:10,380
硬硬地顶着你
that's what that is.

382
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:15,700
我的脖子
Neck... going.

383
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:16,860
对不起
I'm sorry.

384
00:16:25,109 --> 00:16:27,806
-有人在吗 帮帮忙 -快叫警卫
- Anyone! Anyone, help! - Alert security!

385
00:16:28,321 --> 00:16:30,007
封锁这个岛
Seal off the island!

386
00:16:31,117 --> 00:16:32,704
这边 这边
This- This way! This way!

387
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:34,800
莉莉
Lily!

388
00:16:35,907 --> 00:16:38,207
是不是在找人啊
Aha. You looking for someone?

389
00:16:38,207 --> 00:16:41,229
莉莉 我们担心死了 都怪我们说话说忘记了
Lily. We were so worried. We just got distracted.

390
00:16:41,229 --> 00:16:43,058
-我们真是白痴 -别自责了
- Oh, we're idiots. - Ay! Don't beat yourself up.

391
00:16:43,058 --> 00:16:45,380
我过去也老是把曼尼弄丢
I used to lose Manny all the time.

392
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:48,720
现在我把你爸也给丢了 这种事很平常
Now I lost your father. These things happen.

393
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:51,500
她说的对
She's right, you know.

394
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,780
她是不是说我爸失踪了
Did she say my father's missing?

395
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:01,280
我们总说会抽时间 可总被生活琐事缠绕
We say we'll make time, but life gets in the way.

396
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:04,000
我是说 我们的确已经为人父母
I mean, I know we're parents,

397
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:05,580
但难道不能同时做亲密爱人吗
but can't we be lovers too?

398
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:07,540
这也许是我最糟糕的一次生日了
This may be my worst birthday ever.

399
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:09,240
你终于来了
There you are!

400
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,774
亲爱的 你好
Oh, hi, honey.

401
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:13,341
他被卡在吊床上 当时实在太搞笑了
He was stuck in a hammock. It was actually really funny.

402
00:17:13,341 --> 00:17:15,637
-我趴在他身"上"大概20分钟 -你好走了
- I was on top of him for, like, 20 minutes. - You need to go now.

403
00:17:15,637 --> 00:17:17,303
晚安 亲爱的
Good night. Honey.

404
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,560
我的背疼发作了
My back seized up.

405
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:22,080
废话 都是因为
Yeah, because you overdid it

406
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,980
你接了那通电话后运动过量了
after that phone call about your father.

407
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:25,720
真不敢相信我已经和他当时一样老了
I can't believe I'm as old as he was.

408
00:17:26,659 --> 00:17:27,935
等等 坐这缓缓
Wait. Sit down here.

409
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:35,360
-你会喜欢他的 我父亲 -没错
- You'd have liked him- my old man. - I'm sure.

410
00:17:36,738 --> 00:17:38,178
他也会很喜欢你的
And he'd have loved you.

411
00:17:39,140 --> 00:17:41,041
那老家伙可是魅力十足
My God, that guy- He was a charmer.

412
00:17:41,041 --> 00:17:42,780
你不就是那种类型吗
Mmm, I know the type.

413
00:17:43,664 --> 00:17:44,975
我们一起度过了很多欢乐时光
And we had a lot of fun.

414
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:48,080
可我要告诉你点事
But I'll tell you something.

415
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:51,280
我们的家庭度假可一点都不像这样
Our family vacations were nothing like this here.

416
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:54,620
每年在伊利湖畔租的农舍里
One week a year in a rented cottage on Lake Erie,

417
00:17:54,620 --> 00:17:55,960
那里的蜘蛛都有这么大
spiders this big.

418
00:17:57,860 --> 00:18:00,580
我倒蛮希望他能看到我们过上好日子了
I just wish he could have seen how things turned out.

419
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:02,660
要是你继续这样
Well, if you keep going like this,

420
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,740
你马上就能亲自告诉他了
maybe you can tell him yourself.

421
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:07,340
或者我也行 因为你也会把我害死的 杰
Or I can tell him, because you're about to kill me, Jay.

422
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:11,080
我得腿 胳膊和背 全身上下都在痛
My legs, my arms, my back- everything is sore.

423
00:18:11,220 --> 00:18:12,440
我把你"折腾"得筋疲力尽是吧
So I wore you out, huh?

424
00:18:12,741 --> 00:18:15,100
不不 别得意忘形 老家伙
Oh, no, no, no. Don't get cocky, old man.

425
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:17,040
我坐下去至少还能再站起来
When I sit down, I can still get up. Eh.

426
00:18:17,758 --> 00:18:20,572
好了 过来吧
Hey, uh- Okay, come on.

427
00:18:21,766 --> 00:18:23,749
过来 过来
Come here. Come here.

428
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:26,220
剩下的假期过的很愉快
The rest of the trip went better.

429
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,782
海莉的头不再晕了
Haley's room stopped spinning.

430
00:18:27,782 --> 00:18:29,280
-是的 没错 -接着一个猴子
- Yes, it is. - And a monkey-

431
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,579
看看谁来了
There she is!

432
00:18:30,579 --> 00:18:32,493
亲爱的 你好阿
Oh, honey! Hey!

433
00:18:32,493 --> 00:18:34,720
-要来点松饼荷包蛋吗 太美味了 -不要
- Do you want some eggs Benedict? So creamy! - No.

434
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,280
不要吗
No?

435
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:40,420
杰如愿以偿地度过了他想要的轻松假期
Jay got back to the vacation he always wanted.

436
00:18:46,654 --> 00:18:49,160
米奇和小卡也出去观光了
And Mitch and Cam managed to do some sightseeing...

437
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,360
在香蕉园里游览了一番
at a working banana plantation-

438
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:53,319
-莉莉 -在那貌似他们又丢了莉莉
- Lily! - Where they promptly lost Lily again.

439
00:18:53,319 --> 00:18:55,260
你干嘛要把她打扮成和丛林一个颜色
Why did you dress her in jungle prints?

440
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:56,901
因为我觉得那样可爱
Because I thought it would be cute!

441
00:18:56,901 --> 00:18:58,580
她会感觉她又回到了越南
She's gonna think she's back in Vietnam!

442
00:18:58,580 --> 00:19:00,820
莉莉 莉莉 亲爱的
Lily! Lily, honey!

443
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:02,700
我和克莱尔 我们
Me and Claire, we-

444
00:19:04,220 --> 00:19:05,500
我们度过了一段美好时光
we had a great time.

445
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:07,480
但我们仍没能度成蜜月
But we never did get that honeymoon.

446
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:11,560
我想我对这次的度假期望太高了
I think I just expected a little too much from this vacation.

447
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:13,440
有这份心意在就行了
You were so sweet to try.

448
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:14,620
现在想想真蠢
It was dumb.

449
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,441
像你说的那样 我们的激情消缺了
Like you said, the thrill is gone.

450
00:19:17,441 --> 00:19:19,252
-我从来没这么说过 -不 的确没了
- I never said that. - No, it's over.

451
00:19:20,420 --> 00:19:23,740
等等 我们可以再把时间稍微调回点
But wait. Put a few seconds back on the clock.

452
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,020
孩子们可是很积极的
The kid still has a few moves.

453
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:28,140
我的天呐
Oh, my God.

454
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,780
我搞明白为什么我们不能有个像样的蜜月了
I figured out why we couldn't have a honeymoon.

455
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:33,680
因为我们还没有举办过婚礼
Because we never had a wedding.

456
00:19:34,500 --> 00:19:35,500
我的天呐
Oh, my God.

457
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,700
我还是猜不透你到底是喜欢还是讨厌
I still can't tell if you think this is lame or cool.

458
00:19:40,026 --> 00:19:41,925
亲爱的 我当然喜欢
Honey, it's incredibly cool.

459
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,240
-看来我终于可以陪你走完红地毯了 -老爸
- Looks like I finally get to walk you down the aisle. - Daddy!

460
00:19:47,669 --> 00:19:48,454
看来还得你带着我走
Ow! You better walk me.

461
00:19:48,454 --> 00:19:50,035
好吧 我尽量
Okay. I'll do that.

462
00:19:51,180 --> 00:19:54,340
我们今天欢聚一堂 共同来重温
We're here today to celebrate the renewing of the marriage vows...

463
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,560
菲尔和克莱尔喜结连理
of Phil and Claire.

464
00:19:55,560 --> 00:20:00,480
今天 他们选择重申对彼此的爱意坚定不移
On this day they've chosen to reaffirm their love for each other.

465
00:20:00,683 --> 00:20:03,279
你现在可以亲吻你的新娘了
You may kiss your bride. Oh!

466
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:06,107
我郑重宣布 他们依然是夫妇
I present to you, still as husband and wife,

467
00:20:06,107 --> 00:20:07,793
邓菲夫妇
Mr. And Mrs. Dunphy.

468
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:42,757
欢迎你乘坐茂伊岛直飞洛杉矶的航班
Welcome to the nonstop flight from Maui to Los Angeles.

469
00:20:42,757 --> 00:20:45,123
感谢你选择美国大陆航空
Thank for you choosing Continental Airlines.

470
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:46,060
谢谢你
Thank you.

471
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:48,240
亲爱的
You know, honey,

472
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:50,380
要是我有什么不测
if anything were ever to happen to me,

473
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:51,560
我希望你能再婚
I would want you to get remarried.

474
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:52,440
好的
Okay.

475
00:20:53,146 --> 00:20:54,822
你答应得很快嘛
That was a little fast.

476
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:57,140
别乱想 我只是想让你开心
Oh, no. I just want to make you happy.

477
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:58,300
好吧
Okay.

478
00:20:59,981 --> 00:21:03,260
-你有未来再婚的人选吗 -应该是薇姬·康洛伊
- Any idea of who you would remarry? - Vicky Conroy probably.

479
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:04,360
她和我一个办公室
She works in my office.

480
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:06,700
做事很有条例 孩子们都很喜欢她
She's very organized. The kids love her.

481
00:21:06,919 --> 00:21:09,280
-你们在说薇姬吗 -是的
- Are you guys talking about Vicky? - Yeah.

482
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:10,560
妈妈 她棒极了
Mom, she's awesome.

483
00:21:14,580 --> 00:21:17,140
我也想让你知道 要是我有什么不测
Just so you know, if something were to happen to me, I-

484
00:21:17,140 --> 00:21:19,140
你不会发生不测的 别乱说
Something's gonna happen to you, all right.
